    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>About this game</u></strong><br><u>Edge of Death is a horror survival adventure game independently developed by a middle-aged poor rapper. The story takes place between the life and death of an ordinary policeman! In the back of his brain, to be exact! Players will encounter various monsters and ghosts in a strange space and find a way to escape. As the plot deepens, demons hiding in the dark gradually surface. This game will bring you a unique experience!</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/eae4cdf8334a895982d9cfd19560d2ee.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=602 /></span><br><br>\u3010 Brief Introduction \u3011<br><strong>Game kit manual Gift on the shop page</strong>\u2197\u2197<br>* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *<br>\u2193 \u2193 Hospital level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>Level 1. We need two keys, one at the wooden horse, one at the morgue.<br>Level 2, needed a key at the cave door, underneath a nearby body with its head upside down.</i><br>\u2193 \u2193 Pond level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>Need to talk to the whale. Find the three Sparks and talk to them.</i><br>\u2193 \u2193 Death Maze level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>Find the green gate, find the brain and enter the cranial nerve into the depths of memory.</i><br>\u2193 \u2193 Rain level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>If you encounter a card at this time, you can go find a white chicken toy and get super bullet</i><br>* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Game features</u></strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/514f999c4887f48f8d6770886e970e92.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>The nostalgic '80s VHS art style, the weird core atmosphere, reminiscent of the early' 80s fantasy horror movies.<br>The game seeks horror from the outside in. The face horror is everywhere, but the real horror lies beneath the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/1fc587be78fa417c37fae7b40787648b.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>You will follow in the footsteps of the main character, embark on a journey full of thriller and unknown exploration, to find the truth of the story.<br>It's weird and it's kind of weird, but it's probably happening somewhere and it's just not being talked about.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/73d850837580d80dc858ce318ba3be49.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>A game within a game, a story within a story. The player needs to feel. Different players will have different answers and experiences about death!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/a2170bd0f877f879b3e4157b602e137e.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>The difficulty design is just right, not difficult but challenging. The puzzles are tightly integrated with the story, making the story experience more interesting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/243045da4ad0538fcd9aaf71a56ba358.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=602 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/309b9ab51e353bf8ae8e9992fe2ab92b.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=74 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><u>About this game</u></strong><br><u>Edge of Death is a horror survival adventure game independently developed by a middle-aged poor rapper. The story takes place between the life and death of an ordinary policeman! In the back of his brain, to be exact! Players will encounter various monsters and ghosts in a strange space and find a way to escape. As the plot deepens, demons hiding in the dark gradually surface. This game will bring you a unique experience!</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/eae4cdf8334a895982d9cfd19560d2ee.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=602 /></span><br><br>\u3010 Brief Introduction \u3011<br><strong>Game kit manual Gift on the shop page</strong>\u2197\u2197<br>* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *<br>\u2193 \u2193 Hospital level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>Level 1. We need two keys, one at the wooden horse, one at the morgue.<br>Level 2, needed a key at the cave door, underneath a nearby body with its head upside down.</i><br>\u2193 \u2193 Pond level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>Need to talk to the whale. Find the three Sparks and talk to them.</i><br>\u2193 \u2193 Death Maze level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>Find the green gate, find the brain and enter the cranial nerve into the depths of memory.</i><br>\u2193 \u2193 Rain level \u2193 \u2193<br><i>If you encounter a card at this time, you can go find a white chicken toy and get super bullet</i><br>* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Game features</u></strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/514f999c4887f48f8d6770886e970e92.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>The nostalgic '80s VHS art style, the weird core atmosphere, reminiscent of the early' 80s fantasy horror movies.<br>The game seeks horror from the outside in. The face horror is everywhere, but the real horror lies beneath the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/1fc587be78fa417c37fae7b40787648b.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>You will follow in the footsteps of the main character, embark on a journey full of thriller and unknown exploration, to find the truth of the story.<br>It's weird and it's kind of weird, but it's probably happening somewhere and it's just not being talked about.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/73d850837580d80dc858ce318ba3be49.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>A game within a game, a story within a story. The player needs to feel. Different players will have different answers and experiences about death!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/a2170bd0f877f879b3e4157b602e137e.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>The difficulty design is just right, not difficult but challenging. The puzzles are tightly integrated with the story, making the story experience more interesting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/243045da4ad0538fcd9aaf71a56ba358.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=602 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753660/extras/309b9ab51e353bf8ae8e9992fe2ab92b.avif?t=1749358761\" width=600 height=74 /></span>",
